      "updated_at": "2026-03-21T13:38:42Z",
      "body": "Does it happen when we actually release the context while doing the hash or even with the GIL held?\n\nI do not think we canndo anything here as this just means that you call exit() in the middle of something else. I suspect it also crashes in plain C. Could you check it?",
